<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco said raised by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco said raised by Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman raised its rating of Huntco Inc on Thursday to market outperform from perform, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Wednesday at 11.</p>
</text>
